[2m│[0m [2m• Legs on different races are independent: the slip probability is the product of their probabilities.[0m               [2m│[0m
[2m│[0m [2m• Legs on the same race are priced jointly from simulations when they are available (passed in, or a stored combo [0m   [2m│[0m
